{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生の\n瀬戸口心月（せとぐち みつき）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Trick or Treat!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お菓子をくれなきゃいたずらしちゃうぞ🎃"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobqeOBTN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は、ハロウィンですね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん楽しんでますか？⭐️\nなんか仮装したりしたんですかね！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ、教えてください♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "10/26のオンラインミート＆グリートでは、\nハロウィン用にプチ仮装をしましたー！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんが反応してくださって嬉しかったです♡\nありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mob4AVpIf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは、猫↑↑🐱（ねこみみつき）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobEr8EDn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは、赤ずきんちゃんです↑↑🐺"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年のハロウィンは、いっぱい仮装できて\n皆さんがたくさん褒めてくださって楽しかったです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハロウィンでの仮装はアイドル人生憧れの一つ！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年も楽しみです♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobTlulrZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "↑↑ 仲間発見！！！ミリネコと♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもでも、ハロウィンが終わったら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっとすぐにクリスマスモードに突入しますよね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だから、ラストにちょっと秋っぽい質問に答えていきます！🍂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "《今年は、どんな秋が到来してるかな？私は食欲と睡眠の秋だよ〜🍁🍂》\n🌙私も食欲の秋ですね！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "《そういえば、みつきちゃんは１人本屋さんで買った本は読了されたのでしょうか》\n🌙、、、。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年は、読書の秋にしたいなーーーー📚"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "《秋の旬、サツマイモやかぼちゃの好きな食べ方はある？🍠🎃》\n🌙わぁ、どっちも大好きなんです！\nさつまいもはお味噌汁とかに入ってたり、炊き込みご飯だったり！\nカボチャは、カボチャサラダだったりです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特に、カボチャは今年よくハマっていました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "《今年のハロウィンやってみたい仮装はありますか？》\n🌙今年は、猫と赤ずきんちゃんとギャルの仮装できました！！\n来年に向けて、今から何したいか考えておこうと思います^_^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日のブログは、ハロウィン回でした！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "短めだったので、\nまたすぐブログ書きますね👀✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も1日、お疲れさまでした🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心月（みつき）"}], "source": "official"}